('92aa23d4-e4fa-419f-964a-3664967c059b', 'b1ead201-ffaa-4ba3-886a-033f3a9c1dbe', 'passiondriven.automotive@gmail.com', 'Passion Driven Automotive(Ceramic Coating & Mobile Detailing)', 'SENT', '2026-03-21 14:43:56.014+00', '19d10da4e7427433', '19d10da4e7427433', NULL, '0', '49bd2f11-463d-488c-b455-b985484b602e', 'bullishmoazzam@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.passiondrivenauto.com/', 'ceramic coating page for Passion Driven Automotive(Ceramic Coating & Mobile Detailing)', 'Hey Passion Driven Automotive(Ceramic Coating & Mobile Detailing),\n\nBuilt a sample website page for detailing shops that do ceramic coating. Clean layout, reviews section, booking button.\n\nWant to take a look?\n\nBest,\nDemGrow', NULL, '{}', '2026-03-21 13:52:29.818716+00', NULL),
('196898be-cdef-44ed-8ec1-f7a8ff049ff2', 'b1ead201-ffaa-4ba3-886a-033f3a9c1dbe', 'parwizkamandi@gmail.com', 'PRK auto mobile detailing', 'SENT', '2026-03-21 15:01:58.613+00', '19d10ead2fa3240c', '19d10ead2fa3240c', NULL, '0', 'b28c1d77-3c33-4e30-8c8f-e89bf50125ec', 'thecowsadda@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'http://free-5588748.webadorsite.com/', 'most detailing sites lose the customer before they ever call', 'Hi PRK auto mobile detailing,\n\nA lot of detailing shop sites have the same issue. Someone lands on the page, can''t find pricing, can''t find reviews, and just leaves.\n\nCeramic coating is a big ticket service. People do their research. I put together a page layout that handles all of that properly.\n\nCan I send it your way?\n\nBest,\nDemGrow', NULL, '{}', '2026-03-21 13:52:29.818716+00', NULL),
('c96b59b1-0d43-491f-9587-1151c8fd2c0b', 'b1ead201-ffaa-4ba3-886a-033f3a9c1dbe', 'fsdautospa@gmail.com', 'F.S. DETAIL', 'SENT', '2026-03-21 14:35:01.033+00', '19d10d221876a4d1', '19d10d221876a4d1', NULL, '0', '61d5dcae-54fa-4a87-b0d9-789223cc37d8', 'demgrowpaypal@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://fsmobiledetail.com/?utm_source=GMB+Listing&utm_medium=Organic&utm_campaign=GMB+click+thru&utm_id=GMB', 'F.S. DETAIL – made something for your shop', 'Hey F.S. DETAIL,\n\nI build sites for detailing shops and put together a sample ceramic coating page I wanted to show you.\n\nHeadline, service breakdown, customer reviews, booking button. Took a couple hours to build and I think it''d work well for a shop like yours.\n\nWant to see it?\n\nbest , \nDemGrow', NULL, '{}', '2026-03-21 13:52:29.818716+00', NULL),
('c5d5dcd5-1966-48fd-a56b-6f8a7ea019ae', 'b1ead201-ffaa-4ba3-886a-033f3a9c1dbe', 'mo.mobiledetailing@yahoo.com', 'Mo’s Mobile Detailing', 'SENT', '2026-03-21 14:53:06.55+00', '19d10e2b41061e98', '19d10e2b41061e98', NULL, '0', '9940988f-ce26-4533-987b-ab41b77be81a', 'mozartotrader@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.mos-mobile-detailing.com/', 'how some detailers nearby are picking up more bookings', 'Hi Mo’s Mobile Detailing,\n\nA few shops I''ve worked with recently started getting more inbound after we fixed how their ceramic coating page was laid out. Mostly just getting reviews and the booking path in the right spots.\n\nI have a sample of that. Thought it might be worth showing you.\n\nGood to send it over?\n\nBest,\nDemGrow', NULL, '{}', '2026-03-21 13:52:29.818716+00', NULL),
