('8a1d8296-b22a-4284-8818-6782228d7722', 'b1ead201-ffaa-4ba3-886a-033f3a9c1dbe', 'vwmiller@gmail.com', 'Flawless Finish Mobile Detailing', 'SENT', '2026-03-21 17:58:00.722+00', '19d118bfc01811f7', '19d118bfc01811f7', NULL, '0', 'adcd2c76-b2d9-4474-be00-826632835e96', 'demgrowads@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'http://www.flawlessfinishdetail.com/', 'most detailing sites lose the customer before they ever call', 'Hi Flawless Finish Mobile Detailing,\n\nA lot of detailing shop sites have the same issue. Someone lands on the page, can''t find pricing, can''t find reviews, and just leaves.\n\nCeramic coating is a big ticket service. People do their research. I put together a page layout that handles all of that properly.\n\nCan I send it your way?\n\nBest,\nDemGrow', NULL, '{}', '2026-03-21 13:52:29.818716+00', NULL),
('cdeb5c3a-a0cf-4361-9b15-d8c7aa803c5b', 'b1ead201-ffaa-4ba3-886a-033f3a9c1dbe', 'email@example.com', 'YuDetailz - Ceramic VIP Car Detailing San Diego', 'BOUNCED', '2026-03-21 18:12:06.102+00', '19d1198e80a9d0c2', '19d1198e28691727', NULL, '0', '864eb27b-f59a-434a-b9a5-3c35183d2f5d', 'moazzam.insta@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'http://yudetailz.com/', 'one page change and a detailer went from calls only to online bookings', 'Hi YuDetailz - Ceramic VIP Car Detailing San Diego,\n\nA shop I helped a while back was getting all their business through word of mouth. After we rebuilt their ceramic coating page, online bookings started coming in regularly.\n\nThe difference was mostly layout. Reviews up top, clear service breakdown, one button.\n\nI put a sample together. Want to see it?\n\nBest,\nDemGrow', NULL, '{}', '2026-03-21 13:52:29.818716+00', NULL),
('8d021251-f2c1-40f2-8135-223964fda353', 'b1ead201-ffaa-4ba3-886a-033f3a9c1dbe', 'officialcaliforniadetailing@gmail.com', 'Official California Detailing', 'SENT', '2026-03-21 18:05:53.2+00', '19d1193327c7a0ee', '19d1193327c7a0ee', NULL, '0', '3837ef9c-16ea-4a69-8d89-613cd1b7ef8c', 'tv247365.mama@gmail.com', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://www.officialcaliforniadetailing.com/', 'your work is good, Official California Detailing – the site should say that', 'Hey Official California Detailing,\n\nCame across your shop and your work looks great. The website just doesn''t reflect that yet.\n\nI built a sample ceramic coating page with the kind of layout that actually builds trust before someone picks up the phone. Thought it might be relevant.\n\nShould I send it over?\n\nBest,\nDemGrow', NULL, '{}', '2026-03-21 13:52:29.818716+00', NULL),
